### Presenter Tips (so it lands)

* Use the **stories** as anchors; after each, ask: “What would *we* have seen, and when?”
* Keep the **tech analogies** (“PDF that’s a mini-webpage”, “AI agent reads poison text”)—they stick with non-engineers.
* When someone asks “Isn’t this overkill?” reply with **one control mapped to one story** (e.g., *MFA everywhere* ↔ Change Healthcare).
* Offer a **live demo** if you can: a red-team “fake PDF” (safe) that shows it’s really scriptable SVG—then display the CDR policy blocking it.

